but I just can't afford it right now.&nbsp;
So high inflation, interest rates,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:21.600
those are the type of things that.
Speaker 2: We've still got to work on in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:25.609
this economy. And, you know, Janet Yellen.
Speaker 3: Will paint a pretty picture.&nbsp;

